+        <li pn="section-2-238.4">Singapore: requires political and religious content providers
+to register with the state</li>
+        <li pn="section-2-238.5">New Zealand: classifies computer disks as &quot;publications&quot; that
+can be censored and seized</li>
+        <li pn="section-2-238.6">source: Human Rights Watch</li>
+      </ul>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-2-239">vBNS additions: Baylor College of Medicine, Georgia Tech, Iowa
+State Univ, Ohio State Univ, Old Dominion Univ, Univ of CA, Univ of
+CO, Univ of Chicago, Univ of IL, Univ of MN, Univ of PA, Univ of
+TX, Rice Univ</t>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-2-240">CERT advisories: 27, reports: 2573</t>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-2-241">Country domains registered: Qatar (QA), Vientiane (LA), Djibouti
+(DJ), Niger (NE), Central African Republic (CF), Mauretania (MF),
