+      <t indent="0" pn="section-2-242">Technologies of the Year: Search engines, JAVA, Internet Phone
+Emerging Technologies: Virtual environments (VRML), Collaborative
+tools, Internet appliance (Network Computer)</t>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-2-243">1997</t>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-2-244">2000th RFC: &quot;Internet Official Protocol Standards&quot;</t>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-2-245">71,618 mailing lists registered at Liszt, a mailing list directory</t>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-2-246">The American Registry for Internet Numbers (ARIN) is established to
